    nextSteps: "Seek an assessment promptly, especially after psychosis, a medical emergency, suicidal thinking, or repeated inability to stop. Build a practical plan for sleep, food, hydration, transportation, drug-free contacts, high-risk places, and rapid return to care after any renewed use.",
