    evidence: "FDA requires boxed warnings about abuse, addiction, physical dependence, and withdrawal for the benzodiazepine class. Current clinical guidance recommends gradual, individualized tapering when risks outweigh benefits rather than abrupt discontinuation, with the pace adjusted to symptoms, duration of use, dose, health, and patient response.",
